// The position of the choice the open menu or gallery has hot, which is the one an event answered chosen for; -1 when nothing is open. A colour grid has the one answer rbe_note_colour wrote, so its choice is the first.
ribbon_choice_hot() {
  int ribbon_choice_hot_popup = (import ribbon_fit_state)[(import rbd_s_pk)];
  int ribbon_choice_hot_result = -1;
